BETA_UNICODE

  × This escape is half of a surrogate pair.
   ╭─[test.mori:1:12]
 1 │ const e = "\uD83D!";
   ·            ───┬──
   ·               ╰── this half has no partner
   ╰────
  help: A character above U+FFFF is written as a high escape followed by a low
        one, like `\uD83D\uDE00`. You can also write the character directly.
